cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use LongiHealth in research, please cite it as below."
title: "LongiHealth: A Reproducible Longitudinal EHR Analytics Pipeline"
abstract: >-
  LongiHealth is a reproducible research software pipeline for
  longitudinal electronic health record analytics and exploratory
  hospital mortality prediction. It emphasizes leakage-safe cohort
  construction, temporal feature extraction, patient-level splitting,
  training-only preprocessing, and baseline machine learning.
